OL,4,CCovid-19 inquiry to release report     
OL,5,Cinto test, trace, and isolate system   
OL,6,GThe UK Covid-19 Inquiry is set to      
OL,7,Grelease its report into the test,      
OL,8,Gtrace and isolate programmes during    
OL,9,Gthe pandemic.                          
OL,11,FThe systems, run by the UK and         
OL,12,Fdevolved administrations, aimed to     
OL,13,Fidentify who was infected - and with   
OL,14,Fwhom they had been in contact.         
OL,16,FTest and trace employed tens of        
OL,17,Fthousands of people and cost tens of   
OL,18,Fbillions of pounds - but the           
OL,19,Feffectiveness has been questioned.     
